Pre-existing, unrelated to NEARS-2460 — captured during regression sweep of VendorApp
"My Business Plan" -> "Transaction" tab (store 21, fastmarket@demo.com), emulator-5566,
2026-08-26.

Same class of defect as the previously-documented ItemModel.fromJson bug
(docs/apps/vendorapp/vendorapp-screen-inventory.md, NEARS-540/NEARS-2261): backend
returns `offset` as an int, but the Dart model field is declared `String?` and assigns
it unconverted.

File: VendorApp/lib/features/subscription/domain/models/subscription_transaction_model.dart:17
  offset = json['offset'];   // json['offset'] is an int; field declared `String? offset`

