Effect: the API call succeeds (http_status=200) but the transaction list silently
fails to parse — the "Transaction" tab of My Business Plan never populates. Does NOT
block NEARS-2460's AC1 (login / Menu reachability / no expiry gate) — encountered
while regression-sweeping the My Business Plan screen reached as part of that AC.

